Database - Entity
1. All property in database have a default value and not null property
2. All status property type is number and export enum for status with x_STATUS

Controller
1. Use POST method for all PUT , PATCH, DELETE
2. Only throw HttpException with status code 400 and 401.
3. when all request success, all response have status code 200
4. when update a data entity, client always send request with full dto, and update
5. if get data, if not filter property -> send request with value default = -1